{% comment %}
  What's Inside — a titled list of what arrives in the box (Figma: What's Inside).

  The section owns the column and the space in it; the title and the grid are
  blocks, so a second page can open the same section with a different line. See
  `docs/section-settings.md`.

  The cards themselves live in [_ui-inclusion-cards], which is where the products
  and the hand-written entries are put end to end.
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%}
  A product that has not said what is in its box has no What's Inside, so the whole
  section stands down — heading, padding and all — rather than opening on a title
  over one card about gift boxes that is true of everything in the shop.

  The test is what the blocks actually drew, because the list can arrive from three
  places — the product's metafield, the products picked in the editor, and the
  hand-written cards — and only [_ui-inclusion-cards] knows which of them landed. It
  marks the grid when the first two did, and the hand-written cards ride along with
  that list rather than standing in for it, which is how the file draws them: the
  fourth card of four.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture whats_inside_blocks -%}{% content_for 'blocks' %}{%- endcapture -%}

{%- if whats_inside_blocks contains 'ui-inclusion-cards--from-product' -%}
  <div
    class="section section--{{ section.settings.section_width }} spacing-style color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}"
    style="{% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}"
    data-testid="whats-inside-{{ section.id }}"
    {{ section.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    <div
      class="whats-inside whats-inside--{{ section.settings.heading_alignment }}"
      style="--whats-inside-gap: {{ section.settings.gap }}px;"
    >
      {{ whats_inside_blocks }}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .whats-inside {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;

    /* Stretch, not centre: the title centres itself through `text-align`, while the
       grid has to keep the full width of the column to divide into cards. */
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: var(--whats-inside-gap, 32px);
  }

  .whats-inside--center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .whats-inside--start {
    text-align: start;
  }

  /* The alignment above is the title's. Left to inherit it would centre the copy
     inside every card too, which the file draws left in all of them. */
  .whats-inside .ui-inclusion-cards {
    text-align: start;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "What's Inside",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "heading_alignment",
      "label": "Content alignment",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "Centred"
        },
        {
          "value": "start",
          "label": "Left"
        }
      ],
      "default": "center",
      "info": "Where the title sits above the cards."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "gap",
      "label": "Space under the title",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 64,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "section_width",
      "label": "t:settings.width",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "page-width",
          "label": "t:options.page"
        },
        {
          "value": "full-width",
          "label": "t:options.full"
        }
      ],
      "default": "page-width"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.colors"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:settings.color_scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "t:settings.top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "t:settings.bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "_ui-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "_ui-text"
    },
    {
      "type": "_ui-inclusion-cards"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "What's Inside",
      "category": "t:categories.product",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "_ui-heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<h2>What's <em>Inside</em></h2>"
          }
        },
        "cards": {
          "type": "_ui-inclusion-cards",
          "blocks": {
            "packaging": {
              "type": "_ui-inclusion-card",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Gift-Ready Packaging",
                "body": "<p>Beautifully arranged in a premium gift box, ready to deliver a heartfelt message without any extra wrapping.</p>"
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": ["packaging"]
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["heading", "cards"]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
